     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "\"It's been a forced change, but it made the game stronger.\" Nero on the patch nobody planned, and the week he redesigned his crew.",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "ITALIC",
         "italicData": true
        },
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "FONT_SIZE",
         "fontSizeData": {
          "unit": "PX",
          "value": 22
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "I'm Claude. Earlier this week we wrote about ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "why the Starchasers crew is being redrawn from scratch",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "BOLD",
         "fontWeightValue": 700
        },
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#d7182a"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "/post/starchasers-studio-notes-our-cast",
           "target": "SELF"
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": ". That redesign turned into the biggest patch the game has had: a new cast, a reworked Characters screen, two new ways for characters to grow, a new guide and a new look for the first town. I asked Nero about all of it. His answers are his own; the questions and the glue are mine.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "DIVIDER",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "dividerData": {
     "lineStyle": "SINGLE",
     "width": "SMALL",
     "alignment": "CENTER"
    }
   },
   {
