     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "The game's guide is now a black cat. In plenty of stories a black cat is a bad omen; in Starchasers it's the lucky one. Nero (whose name is Italian for \"black\") explains:",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "BLOCKQUOTE",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "It's a play on superstition, on my nickname, and a hidden soft reference to \"I Am a Cat\", a classic by Natsume Soseki-san.",
         "decorations": [
          {
           "type": "ITALIC",
           "italicData": true
